---
// src/components/VanillaObjective.astro
---

<section class="py-24 bg-theme-panel relative overflow-hidden transition-colors duration-300">
    
    <div class="absolute top-0 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-[600px] h-[300px] bg-btc-orange/5 blur-[120px] rounded-full pointer-events-none"></div>

    <div class="container mx-auto px-6 relative z-20">
        
        <div class="text-center mb-20">
            <div class="inline-block p-3 rounded-full bg-black/30 backdrop-blur-sm mb-4 border border-white/5">
                <span class="text-3xl grayscale opacity-80">⚖️</span>
            </div>
            <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-display font-bold text-theme-main uppercase tracking-tight">
                Filosofía <span class="text-theme-accent">Semi-Vanilla</span>
            </h2>
            <p class="text-theme-main opacity-80 text-lg max-w-2xl mx-auto mt-4 leading-relaxed">
                El verdadero reto de nuestra ingeniería no es añadir cientos de mods, sino saber <strong class="text-btc-yellow font-bold">cuáles no añadir</strong>. Mantenemos la pureza de Minecraft evitando mecánicas que rompan la progresión.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 max-w-6xl mx-auto">
            
            <div class="bg-zinc-900 p-8 rounded-2xl border border-white/10 hover:border-btc-yellow/50 transition-all duration-300 group relative overflow-hidden shadow-lg hover:-translate-y-1">
                <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-btc-yellow/5 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-300"></div>
                <div class="relative z-10">
                    <div class="w-14 h-14 flex items-center justify-center bg-black/40 rounded-xl group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform overflow-hidden border border-white/5 mb-6">
                        <span class="text-3xl grayscale group-hover:grayscale-0 transition-all duration-300">🎯</span>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="font-display font-bold text-white text-2xl tracking-tight group-hover:text-btc-yellow transition-colors uppercase mb-3">
                        Equilibrio Perfecto
                    </h3>
                    <p class="text-zinc-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                        Las mejoras técnicas respetan la economía y el esfuerzo del survival tradicional. Nada es automático sin esfuerzo; todo se siente como una extensión natural del juego base.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="bg-zinc-900 p-8 rounded-2xl border border-white/10 hover:border-btc-orange/50 transition-all duration-300 group relative overflow-hidden shadow-lg hover:-translate-y-1">
                <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-btc-orange/5 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-300"></div>
                <div class="relative z-10">
                    <div class="w-14 h-14 flex items-center justify-center bg-black/40 rounded-xl group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform overflow-hidden border border-white/5 mb-6">
                        <span class="text-3xl grayscale group-hover:grayscale-0 transition-all duration-300">🛡️</span>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="font-display font-bold text-white text-2xl tracking-tight group-hover:text-btc-orange transition-colors uppercase mb-3">
                        Cero Exageraciones
                    </h3>
                    <p class="text-zinc-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                        Aquí no encontrarás máquinas mágicas ni armaduras desbalanceadas. Solo utilizamos herramientas enfocadas en la optimización extrema y la calidad de vida (QoL).
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="bg-zinc-900 p-8 rounded-2xl border border-white/10 hover:border-blue-500/50 transition-all duration-300 group relative overflow-hidden shadow-lg hover:-translate-y-1">
                <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-blue-500/5 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-300"></div>
                <div class="relative z-10">
                    <div class="w-14 h-14 flex items-center justify-center bg-black/40 rounded-xl group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform overflow-hidden border border-white/5 mb-6">
                        <span class="text-3xl grayscale group-hover:grayscale-0 transition-all duration-300">💎</span>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="font-display font-bold text-white text-2xl tracking-tight group-hover:text-blue-500 transition-colors uppercase mb-3">
                        Esencia Intacta
                    </h3>
                    <p class="text-zinc-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                        Todo lo que construyas, farmees o logres en nuestro mundo tiene exactamente el mismo mérito que en un entorno Vanilla 100% puro, pero con la estabilidad de un servidor técnico.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>

        </div>
    </div>
</section>